\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  Morning: C$ Drops Rapidly, BOC  \highlight22\uc2 Intervenes \highlight\uc2  Heavily \b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Dezember 1997\par 15:23\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (AP-Dow Jones)--The Canadian dollar weakened dramatically after the Bank of Canada passed its 9 a.m. \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  window without raising interest rates this morning, prompting immediate \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading at C$1.4325 at 9:19 a.m. EST (1419 GMT), up from C$1.4214 at 8:00 a.m. EST (1300 GMT), and from C$1.4265 late Thursday. It is now at levels not seen since February 1986, when it reached its all-time high of C$1.4480. \par \par \uc2  The Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has weakened dramatically this month as it succumbed to uncertainty about the economic impact of Asian financial turmoi in addition to usual year-end pressures, negative yield spreads against the U.S., and a current account deficit that surged to C$25.5 billion in the third quarter. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Canada raised its trendsetting bank rate 1/2 point to 4.5% last Friday - the larges increase in about two years - but the resulting rally in the Canadian dollar quickly died out. The bank has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  frequently in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in recent sessions, selling U.S. dollars to bolster the struggling Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par These are the exchange rates at 9:19 a.m. EST (1419 GMT), 8:00 a.m.\par EST (1300 GMT) and late Thursday.\par    U.S./CDN    1.4325     1.4265     1.4265\par    CDN/DEM     1.2371     1.2442     1.2442\par    CDN/YEN     89.90      90.16      90.17\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-12-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1423GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcj09td7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
