\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  dlr hits 11-yr low,  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 286 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Dezember 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TORONTO, Dec 19 (Reuters) - The Canadian dollar tumbled to its lowest point in 11 years on Friday, prompting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily to buy the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  began buying the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at C$1.4285 (US$0.7000), then \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again at C$1.4292 (US$0.6997), the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's lowest point in 11 years. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was ineffective, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened further to reach US$1.4322 (US$0.6982), they said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  steadily since it was first in the market. Dealers said they had last seen the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in at C$1.4320 (US$0.6983). \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened past this level to trade at C$1.4345 (US$0.6971 and was now getting close to its all-time low of C$1.4465 (US$0.6913). \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has weakened so forcefully the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  could hike interest rates outside its normal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  window, which is just before 0900 EST/1400 GMT. \par \par \uc2  "We're sort of getting into new territory," said one \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a bank-owned brokerage. \par \par \uc2  "The bank did not raise rates in the normal window, but that doesn't preclude them from raising rates any time during the day. If the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  really came under attack, it could trigger a move anytime today," he said. \par \par \uc2  But the dealer said that if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does go it is unlikely to bring the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  below levels it opened at this morning. \par \par \uc2  ((Jeffrey Hodgson, Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8105, e-mail: jeffrey.hodgson@reuters.com)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtcj00s72\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
