settling the Canadian dollar. \par \par \uc2  Since the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  the U.S. dollar has edged back to C$1.4234 (at 1:12 p.m. EST), from Monday's close at C$1.4202. \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES NEWS  12-16-97 \par \par \uc2  1318EST \par \par \uc2  4020 4300 4346 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dtcg02sse\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
