\par\par \b \uc2  Canada Morning: Cdn Dlr Range Trading, Watching Far East \b0\par\par\uc2 347 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Dezember 1997\par 15:47\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (AP-Dow Jones)--The Canadian is at a standstill in early trading Wednesday and many market watchers are expecting it to stay in a narrow range for the rest of the sesssion. \par \par \uc2  'I suspect range trading will be the order of the day again ahead of U.S. retail sales tomorrow and the producer price index and third quarter Canadian GDP on Friday,' said Stephen Wateridge, managing director of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading at C$1.4222 at 9:41 a.m. EST (1441 GMT), unchanged from C$1.4222 at 8:00 a.m. EST (1300 GMT), and up slightly from C$1.4223 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  'We're seeing mostly cross-related activity, although the ranges both in the Far East and Europe have been fairly narrow,' Wateridge said. 'There hasn't been a lot of flow in pure dollar/Canada in the last few days.' \par \par \uc2  'Clearly the situation in Japan and Southeast Asia is taking its toll on global markets,' he said. 'We still have to keep a keen eye on developments there.' \par \par \uc2  'It may well be that for the balance of the year we won't see anything other than \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' Wateridge said, explaining that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will likely hold off on increasing interest rates for the rest of 1997. \par \par \uc2  'I guess we're into the December doldrums big time,' said Doug Porter, senior economist with Nesbitt Burns Inc. 'The (Canadian) dollar is essentially in a holding pattern.' \par \par \uc2  Seasonal pressures could push the U.S. dollar up to C$1.430 by the end of the year, he said. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par These are the exchange rates at 9:41 a.m. EST (1441 GMT), 8:00 a.m.\par EST (1300 GMT) and late Tuesday.\par    U.S./CDN    1.4222     1.4222     1.4223\par    CDN/DEM     1.2543     1.2541     1.2582\par    CDN/YEN     90.63      90.46      91.20\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 10-12-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1447GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtca09hdf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
