\par\par \b \uc2  Canada Morning -2: Market Awaits Thiessen Comments \b0\par\par\uc2 283 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Dezember 1997\par 15:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Traders say a wide current account deficit was expected and the news was largely discounted. The U.S. dollar surged to near three-year highs (C$1.4270 hit in January of 1995) in the month of November in part because of anticipation of a worsening current account. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has reconciled itself with the fact that the current account has deteriorated rapidly,' said Doug Porter, senior economist with Nesbitt Burns Inc. \par \par \uc2  One dealer said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ample and frequent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday, Thursday and Friday just above the C1.4245 level is also helping to put a cap on further U.S. dollar gains for now. \par \par \uc2  He said the market nown awaits comments from the Bank of Canada governor, Gordon Thiessen, later today for futher hints at his policy intentions. He speaks in Toronto at 1:00 p.m. EST (1800 GMT). Many analysts thihk the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is prepared to raise interest rates again if needed. Indeed, some reckon the bank will nudge the bank rate up again if Friday's November employment data are strong. \par \par \uc2  Still, Porter said the current account news shouldn't be taken lightly and is bearish for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He thinks the 'account is going to get worse before it gets better,' and could 'potentially' signal a competitiveness problem. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par These are the exchange rates at 8:39 a.m. EST (1339 GMT), 8:00 a.m.\par EST (1300 GMT) and late Friday.\par    U.S./CDN    1.4245     1.4230     1.4238\par    CDN/DEM     1.2458     1.2467     1.2403\par    CDN/YEN     90.46      90.49      89.84\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 01-12-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1444GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtc1096w1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
