\par\par \b \uc2  Canadian dollar closes weaker, hit by sell order. \b0\par\par\uc2 271 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 November 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par FORECAST RANGE   1.4155/1.4200\tab     ASIAN CLOSE     1.4115\par RESISTANCE 1.4054   SUPPORT 1.4285\tab HI 1.4143   LO  1.4116\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par CANADA OPEN  1.4140/45    HI 1.4153     EUROPE OPEN     1.4116\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  PREV CLOSE   1.4129/34    LO 1.4123     HI 1.4126   LO  1.4116 \par \par \uc2  ----------------------MARKET COMMENT------------------------- \par \par \uc2  * Canada's dollar ended softer at C$1.4165 (US$0.7060) on Monday from Friday's close on the back of a large sell order. * Traders did not see Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  today. * Weakness heightened speculation that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might boost short-term interest rates on Tuesday to support \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . * Overnight range forecast: C$1.4155 to C$1.4200. \par \par \uc2  "The market's really testing the Bank of Canada resolve right now," said Harv Kalirai, I.D.E.A. analyst in New York. \par \par \uc2  Some market players have expected a move by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  almost each day in the past two weeks. \par \par \uc2  The trader added that he thought the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was unlikely to hike rates on Tuesday. "They don't want to be seen panicking to protect the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." The bank last raised interest rates by 25 basis points in early October in an effort to slow Canada's fast-expanding economy. \par \par \uc2  The dollar was seen bouncing in the range of C$1.4155 to C$1.4200 in overnight dealings. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, Canada's dollar fell to 88.55 yen from Friday's 88.67 yen and dropped to 1.2206 marks from Friday's 1.2243 marks. \par \par \uc2  ((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtbh02jj5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
