\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  Morning: C$ Weakens, Prompting More BOC  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 242 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Oktober 1997\par 15:30\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (AP-Dow Jones)--The Canadian dollar is back under selling pressure Thursday as continued troubles in global stocks scare investors into the safety of other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  As the U.S. dollar pushed through C$1.4090, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, selling the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in an effort to slow its rise, part of its normal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy. Dealers said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued after the U.S. dollar breached C$1.4100. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading at C$1.4097 at 9:27 a.m. EST (1427 GMT), from C$1.4070 at 8:00 a.m. EST (1300 GMT) and C$1.4016 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Analysts with MMS International say the break above C$1.4100 leaves the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  targeted at C$1.4120 and then the 1997 high at C$1.4160 reached on Tuesday. 'The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals that the bank is not yet ready to raise rates and this will keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  under pressure,' they said. \par \par \uc2  A weaker Canadian dollar loosens monetary conditions in the economy, a situation analysts doubt the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wants to tolerate for long given the apparent strength of the economy. \par \par \uc2  However, many observers think the BOC will hold off raising interest rates so long as the stock markets remain unsettled for fear it could worsen the troubles. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-10-97 \par \par \uc2  1430GMT \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtau08abt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
