has climbed from levels\par just above C$1.3900 to a high of C$1.4160 overseas, reached\par at 4:06 a.m. EST (0906 GMT) on Tuesday.\par    Dealers expect the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to continue its\par aggressive \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in its efforts to smooth out \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par volatility.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES NEWS  10-30-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0914EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4020 4300 4346 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dtau02c7o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
