\par\par \b \uc2  Bk Of  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  Still  \highlight22\uc2 Intervening \highlight\uc2 , Last Seen At C$1.4025 \b0\par\par\uc2 227 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Oktober 1997\par 20:49\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    TORONTO (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market repeatedly Monday, selling U.S.\par dollars at C$1.4025 in mid-afternoon trading in its most\par recent round of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  aimed at discouraging excessive\par volatility in the Canadian dollar, said a trader.\par    The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  tends to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the market when the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  moves about 70 ticks from the previous day's close\par in either direction. The U.S. dollar closed Friday at\par C$1.3918. It first \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Monday around C$1.3880-85.\par    \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been under heavy pressure of late,\par traders say because short-term interest rates here still\par trade considerably below their U.S. counterparts. At 3.40%,\par the three-month rate is 157 basis points below the U.S. rate.\par    The Bank of Canada raised interest rates on Oct. 1 in an\par effort to address the wide gap and the excessive stimulus to\par the domestic economy. It boosted the bank rate 1/4 point to\par 3.75%.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  However, traders have been hoping for an early second\par hike. Many express frustration that it has been slow in\par coming.\par    Since the most recent \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the U.S. dollar has\par hovered right around C$1.4016.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES NEWS  10-27-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1449EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4020 4300 4346 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dtar02a0c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
