the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "(The trade figures) were negative news for the Canadian dollar, but we didn't see much impact because participants were uncertain about what the Bank of Canada would do," Gregory said. \par \par \uc2  However, he expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to continue to weaken in the near term. \par \par \uc2  On the crosses, the Canada dollar dipped to 84.48 Japanese yen on Wednesday from 84.79 yen on Tuesday and climbed to 1.3330 marks from Tuesday's 1.3196 marks. \par \par \uc2  ((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100)) \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt8k00wsy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
