\par\par \b \uc2  World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  -3: Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  Forced To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 329 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 August 1997\par 22:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The market remains nervous before the Bundesbank's council meeting Thursday. Traders said they probably won't try to push the dollar to DM1.8500 until the meeting is out of the way. \par \par \uc2  'After Thursday, there should be some pretty good dollar buying,' predicts Robert McEntee, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Corestates Bank in Philadelphia. \par \par \uc2  Although the Southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis continues to weigh on the yen, the dollar remains hemmed in below Y118.30 on concerns that U.S. data Wednesday will reveal a widening U.S. trade deficit. Economists forecast the figures will show the deficit widened to $10.25 billion in June from $10.23 billion in May. \par \par \uc2  The Canadian dollar fell sharply against the U.S. dollar, prompting the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Canadian dollar's fall began after data showed Canadian inflation slowed in July, suggesting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't tighten credit again for a while. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Canada last raised the target band for its overnight funds rate by a quarter-percentage point to 3.00%-3.50% June 26. \par \par \uc2  Canada's core inflation rate - excluding food and energy - fell to 1.5% in July from 2% in June. The broader inflation rate was unchanged at 1.8% year-on-year and flat in July from June. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to slow the U.S. dollar's rise when it reached C$1.3951. Usually, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has moved 70 ticks or so in either direction over the course of a twenty-four hour span. \par \par \uc2  Informed market sources said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was routine and not an attempt to change the direction of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Late in New York, the dollar was quoted at C$1.3943, up from C$1.3883 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-08-97 \par \par \uc2  2051GMT \par \par \uc2  1033 1865 20714 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8j06604\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
