\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of  \highlight22\uc2 Canada Intervenes \highlight\uc2  -2: Cools C$ Upturn After Fed \b0\par\par\uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Mai 1997\par 20:46\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    TORONTO (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market Tuesday, buying U.S. dollars in the\par C$1.3655 area in an effort to slow a Canadian dollar rally.\par    The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rocketed higher shortly after 2:15 p.m.\par (1815 GMT) when the U.S. Federal Reserve announced it was\par keeping its Federal funds and overnight interest rates\par unchanged. Some analysts had expected the Fed to bump up\par rates, which would have left the Canadian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  relatively\par less attractive.\par    The U.S. dollar fell from C$1.3721 just before the Fed\par announcement (and C$1.3732 late Friday) to a low at about\par C$1.3655 at 2:22 p.m. (The lowest bid it had was at\par C$1.3650.) The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  tends to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  whenever the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  moves about 75 ticks in either direction.\par    Since Thursday, however, it has been \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to cool\par off a hot Canadian dollar, given extra energy after Bank of\par Canada officials signalled last week a readiness to move to a\par tighter monetary policy.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  Just over a week ago the U.S. dollar\par was trading well over C$1.3900.\par    At 2:40 p.m. EDT, the U.S. dollar was trading at\par C$1.3660.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES NEWS  05-20-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1446EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4020 4300 4346 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dt5k01207\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
