 slow the economy. At the same time, Canadian figures have made clear the domestic economy is on a solid footing - some analysts feel the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will soon have to raise rates to ward off future inflation. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 01-05-97 \par \par \uc2  1903GMT \par \par \uc2  4346 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt510344p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
