rency\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying Canadian dollars. The Bank of England also \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on behalf of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  during the European trading session on Thursday when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a new two-year low around C$1.4018 (US$0.7142). \par \par \uc2  Market analysts are awaiting Canada's consumer price index data for March which is scheduled to be released by Statistics Canada on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt4i06sdy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
